The datasheet lists one shared multirate specification block for both ordering codes; only the ordering table separates **SO-SFP-10GE-LR20** (0°C to +70°C) from **SO-SFP-10GE-LR20-I** (industrial −40°C to +85°C). Transmit wavelength **1270–1355 nm**, receiver range **1260–1565 nm**, **0.6–11.3 Gbps**, and all listed standards appear together in that same row—not per-protocol rows. Sensitivity is characterized at **10.3 Gbps**; there are no mode-specific penalties in the excerpt.

